about: A short excerpt of ROLI's demo, to learn from: ROLI, "Seaboard RISE x SWAM & Camelot Pro" (YouTube 11Qprwtzl6s), performed by Heen-Wah Wai, 0:46.0 to 1:02.0,
about: played on a Seaboard with a split: Equator Acoustic Piano | SWAM Viola. Music and performance theirs (all rights reserved).
about: Transcribed for odo by machine (Basic Pitch) with each note's own pitch curve (bends, scoops,
about: vibrato) and loudness (pressure) measured from the recording, in free time (one beat a second).
about: On the touch pad, chromatic: left pad: piano; right pad: viola.
about: A test of how close a touch screen gets to the Seaboard: listen against the video.
